cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project in your work, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Docking Reference Audit"
abstract: "An independent project to build a curated set of publicly available protein-ligand complexes and audit their preparation for reproducible redocking campaigns. Results are descriptive and reproducible; no conclusions about performance, affinity or biological activity are drawn."
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/sircalch/docking-reference-audit"
keywords:
  - molecular docking
  - redocking
  - reproducibility
  - protein-ligand complexes
authors:
